<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιαφόρ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily carried off by
				perspiration</i> or <i>secretion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.10c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
			</span></i><i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				443.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easily distributed</i> or <i>digested</i>, of foods, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.661
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGoodsp.Cair.</u>
				2i11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>easily evaporated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Olymp.
					<u>in Mete.</u>
					299.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>easily perspiring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.583
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
